## Method 6: ```public void removeCard(CardType cardType)```
### Step 1-3 Results
|        | Input                                                                          | (if more to consider for input) | Output                                                                    |
|--------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Step 1 | A `CardType` in the hand, a `CardType` not in the hand, or an empty hand       |                                 | Hand shrinks by 1 / `IllegalArgumentException` (card absent or hand empty) |
| Step 2 | Enumeration (`CardType`) — present in hand, absent from hand, hand empty       |                                 | void / `IllegalArgumentException`                                         |
| Step 3 | `DEFUSE` when hand contains `DEFUSE`; `ATTACK` when absent; `DEFUSE` when empty |                                |  Decremented hand / `IllegalArgumentException` / `IllegalArgumentException` |

