##### All-combination or each-choice: each-choice

|             | System under test                      | Expected output                   | Implemented? |
|-------------|----------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|--------------|
| Test Case 1 | add `DEFUSE`, then `removeCard(DEFUSE)` | `getHand().size()` == `0`        | yes          |
| Test Case 2 | empty hand, `removeCard(ATTACK)`       | `IllegalArgumentException` thrown | yes          |
| Test Case 3 | empty hand, `removeCard(DEFUSE)`       | `IllegalArgumentException` thrown | yes          |

